      <h1 id="flowschema-flowcontrol-apiserver-k8s-io-v1" class="group scroll-mt-20">FlowSchema [flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1]<a href="#flowschema-flowcontrol-apiserver-k8s-io-v1" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>FlowSchema defines the schema of a group of flows. Note that a flow is made up of a set of inbound API requests with similar attributes and is identified by a pair of strings: the name of the FlowSchema and a "flow distinguisher".</p></dd>
      <dt class="font-semibold">Type</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><CodeBlock code={"`object`"} lang="plaintext" /></dd>
      </dl>
