      <li><code>DELETE</code>: delete a FlowSchema</li>
      <li><code>GET</code>: read the specified FlowSchema</li>
      <li><code>PATCH</code>: partially update the specified FlowSchema</li>
      <li><code>PUT</code>: replace the specified FlowSchema</li>
      </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
      <code>/apis/flowcontrol.apiserver.k8s.io/v1/watch/flowschemas/{"{"}name{"}"}</code>
